sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-petroff-stromatolite> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Petroff et al. (2010) Conical Stromatolite Spacing Law & Dome-to-Cone Morphospace faithfully reproduces Photosynthetic microbial mats and conical stromatolites (Conophyton / Yellowstone modern mats) morphology" ;
        dcterms:description "The simulation script(s) 2010-petroff-stromatolite.py, docs/media/petroff_stromatolite_dome_to_cone.gif implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Photosynthetic microbial mats and conical stromatolites (Conophyton / Yellowstone modern mats) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 43.6/100, audit 2026-10-19-petroff-kahng-audit) and the assessments." ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5564750/2010-petroff-stromatolite.py, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5564750/docs/media/petroff_stromatolite_dome_to_cone.gif; output: petroff_stromatolite_morphospace.png; organism: Photosynthetic microbial mats and conical stromatolites (Conophyton / Yellowstone modern mats); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/5564750; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.16.3, matplotlib 3.10.7, Pillow 12.0.0; spec_fingerprint: 2b3289aae8f3466486ffbc5f503dd7585e6e1c2863ac78c108d1488932cf713f; artifact_sha256: 8e00cc6fabe5cf24f1544cbc867b0f6e9501cf7099a7b3da7166a2bf8fd1be01; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Petroff et al. (2010): nutrient diffusion over active photosynthetic period tau sets inter-cone spacing ell = alpha * sqrt(D * tau) (~1 cm for daily cycle), and diffusive flux gradients along the mat interface govern lamina accretion and conical geometry | Batchelor et al. (2004): deterministic KPZ / normal-plus-vertical lamina accretion dh/dt = v + lambda * (1 + 1/2 (dh/dr)^2) transitions from domes to cones as beta = v / lambda increases; reconstructed_in_script: Algebraic diffusion-length spacing law ell = alpha * sqrt(D * tau) for alpha in {1.0, 0.30}, hexagonal close-packed cone lattice, and a 2D Lagrangian polyline front advancing by lambda * n_hat + v * w_photic * z_hat with pinned basal endpoints and 3-point Laplacian smoothing; transfer_boundary: The dome-to-cone lamina solver does not solve Petroff et al.'s Laplace diffusion equation (nabla^2 c = 0) or local diffusive flux; it substitutes a modified Batchelor et al. (2004) kinematic front with an ad-hoc photic weighting w_photic = 0.12 + 0.88*(z/z_max)^2; does_not_claim: Direct comparison to digitized Yellowstone mat or Proterozoic Conophyton thin-section photographs or empirical cone-spacing histograms]" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physa.2004.01.065>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1001978107> ;
        pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-19-petroff-kahng-audit-petroff-stromatolite-code-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-19-petroff-kahng-audit-petroff-stromatolite-model-fidelity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-19-petroff-kahng-audit-petroff-stromatolite-morphometric-validation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-19-petroff-kahng-audit-petroff-stromatolite-overall>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-19-petroff-kahng-audit-petroff-stromatolite-parameter-expressivity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-19-petroff-kahng-audit-petroff-stromatolite-repro-package>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-19-petroff-kahng-audit-petroff-stromatolite-source-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-19-petroff-kahng-audit-petroff-stromatolite-specimen-match> ;
        pk:weightOfEvidence "0.436"^^xsd:double .
}

